eof sixteen.\u201d.\n\n3.Section 17 of the principal enactment is herebyamended by the substitution for the words \u201creceive morethan two thousand rupees by way of gross sum, together withany bonuses or additions declared up on assurances not\n\nAmendmentof section 9of Chapter123.\n\nAmendmentof section 17of theprincipalenactment."
