    "chunk_text": "PRINTED AT THE DEPARTMENT OF GOVERNMENT PRINTING, SRI LANKA\n\nTO BE PURCHASED AT THE GOVERNMENT PUBLICATIONS BUREAU, COLOMBO 1\n\nPrice : Rs. 6.75 Postage : Rs. 4.50\n\nPARLIAMENT OF THE DEMOCRATICSOCIALIST REPUBLIC OFSRI LANKA\n\nPublished as a Supplement to Part II of the Gazette of the Democratic SocialistRepublic of Sri Lanka of November 14, 2003\n\n\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\n\n\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\n\n[Certified on 14th November, 2003]\n\nPrinted on the Order of Government\n\n\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\n\nNATIONAL INSTITUTE OF PLANTATIONMANAGEMENT (AMENDMENT)ACT, No. 38 OF 2003\n\nNational Institute of Plantation Management(Amendment) Act, No. 38 of 20031\n\nShort Title.\n\nAmendment ofsection 4 of Act,No. 45 of 1979.\n\n2 \u2014H 019157 \u20145,650 (07/2003)\n\n[Certified on14th November, 2003]\n\nL. D. \u2013 O. 17/99\n\nAN ACT TO AMEND THE NATIONAL INSTITUTE OF PLANTATIONMANAGEMENT ACT, NO. 45 OF 1979\n\nBE it enacted by the Parliament of the Democratic SocialistRepublic of Sri Lanka as follows :\u2014\n\n1. This Act may be cited as the National Institute ofPlantation Management (Amendment) Act, No. 38 of 2003.\n\n2.Section 4 of the National Institute of PlantationManagement Act, No. 45 of 1979 (hereinafter referred to as\u201cthe principal enactment\u201d ) as amended by Act No. 5 of 1987is further amended as follows :\u2014\n\n(i)by the deletion in paragraph (h), of the word \u201cand\u201d;and\n\n(ii)by the insertion immediately after paragraph (k) ofthe following new paragraphs :\u2014\n\n\u201c(l)promote investment in plantationmanagement ;\n\n(m)undertake the collection anddissemination of data relating toplantations and plantation management,and to conduct research to ascertain thedevelopment potential of plantations ;and\n\n(n)advise the Minister on appropriatepolicies relating to plantationmanagement and to co-ordinate withother relevant agencies.\u201d.\n\n2National Institute of Plantation Management(Amendment) Act, No. 38 of 2003\n\n3. Section 6 of the principal enactment as amended byAct, No. 76 of 1981 and Act, No. 5 of 1987 is hereby furtheramended as follows :\u2014"
