    "chunk_size_bytes": 2083,
    "chunk_text": "PRINTED AT THE DEPARTMENT OF GOVERNMENT PRINTING, SRI LANKA\n\nTO BE PURCHASED AT THE GOVERNMENT PUBLICATIONS BUREAU, COLOMBO 1\n\nPrice : Rs. 8.25 Postage : Rs. 4.50\n\nPARLIAMENT OF THE DEMOCRATICSOCIALIST REPUBLIC OFSRI LANKA\n\nPublished as a Supplement to Part II of the Gazette of the Democratic SocialistRepublic of Sri Lanka of April 04, 2003\n\n\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\n\n\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\n\n[Certified on 01st April, 2003]\n\nPrinted on the Order of Government\n\n\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\n\nCITIZENSHIP (AMENDMENT) ACT, No. 16 OF 2003\n\nCitizenship (Amendment) Act, No. 16 of 20031\n\n2\u2014H 016820\u20145,650 (2002/09)\n\n[Certified on 01st April, 2003]\n\nL. D.\u2014O. 11/2002.\n\nAN ACT TO AMEND THE CITIZENSHIP ACT\n\nBe it enacted by the Parliament of the Democratic SocialistRepublic of Sri Lanka as follows :\u2014\n\n1.This Act may be cited as the Citizenship (Amendment)Act, No. 16 of 2003.\n\n2.Section 2 of the Citizenship Act (hereinafter referredto as the \u201cprincipal enactment\u201d) is hereby amended by therepeal of subsection (3) and the substitution therefor of thefollowing new subsection :\u2014\n\n\u201c(3)Every person who has possessed of theaforesaid status is hereinafter referred to as a \u201cCitizen ofSri Lanka.\u201d.\n\n3.Section 5 of the principal enactment is hereby amendedas follows :\u2014\n\n(1)in subsection (1) of that section by the substitution,for the words \u201ccitizen of Ceylon by descent if at thetime of his birth his father is a citizen of Ceylon\u201d ofthe words \u201ccitizen of Sri Lanka if at the time of hisbirth either of his parents is or was a citizen of SriLanka.\u201d; and\n\n(2)in subsection (2) of that section by the substitution ,for the words \u201ccitizen of Ceylon by descent if at thetime of his birth his father is a citizen of Ceylon\u201d ofthe words \u201ccitizen of Sri Lanka if at the time of hisbirth either of his parents is or was a citizen of SriLanka.\u201d;\n\n4.The following new section is hereby insertedimmediately after section 5 of the principal enactment andshall have effect as section 5A of that enactment :\u2014\n\nAmendment ofsection 5 of theprincipalenactment."
  },
