mil texts of this Act, the Sinhala text shall prevail.\n\nAmendment ofSection 122 of theprincipalenactment.\n\nSinhala text toprevail in case ofinconsistency.\n\nMonetary Law (Amendment) Act, No. 32 of 200225"
